# Xcode / SwiftPM build artifacts — the .xcodeproj itself IS committed (generated
# from project.yml), but per-user and derived state is not.

## Build output
build/
DerivedData/
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Xcode per-user state (inside the committed .xcodeproj)
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## SwiftPM
.build/
Packages/*/.build/
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
.swiftpm/xcode/xcuserdata/

## Misc
.DS_Store
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
